column612:
 "body": "I've given a thought to @joerchan proposal to unify both enums. I suggest is: don't do it. 
Enum provided in gap.h has different purpose and there is missing one value: `BT_GAP_CTE_ONLY`. The purpose of the enum seems to be limiting a periodic advertising syncs depending of CTE type.

The CTE types used by Direction finding RX and TX are subset of the CTE type defined in gap.h. But pay attention that DF does not use something like `CTE_NONE` or `CTE_ONLY` and that may be confusing for app developers.

I will unify CTE types but only within DF implementation. I'll create an issue in github to update DF connectionless TX parameters to use the unified version of CTE types after this PR is merged.

@Thalley @joerchan what do you think about it?
"}

