We tend to update `west.yml` in a separate commit. You can check `git log` and see how @chrta has done it. The commit updating `west.yml` should be followed up by a single commit adding BRD4255A radio board.

You can either do it using `git rebase -i` or start from scratch by means of `git reset`. To reuse an existing commit message when redoing the commit you can `git commit --reuse-message=<commit>`. At the end you'll need to force push your updates."}

