column130:
 "body": "It would be cleaner if we ignored `GPIO_INPUT` flag and added `else` branch here. I.e. let's remove 
```
	if ((flags & GPIO_INPUT) != 0U) {
		GPDR &= ~BIT(pin);
	}
```
and instead add here
```
	} else {
		GPDR &= ~BIT(pin);
	}
```
Since it's in fact `GPIO_OUTPUT` flag that exclusively controls the setting of the GPDR register."}

