 "body": "The TRASLA register already splits the I2C target address into ADR [7:1] and R/W [0] fields.
Perform this shift when writing to the TRASLA register to better match the datasheet.

IT83XX_SMB_TRASLA(base) = (uint8_t)(data->addr_16bit << 1 ) | 0x01;

Do the same thing when calling i2c_pio_trans_data."}

