column106:
 as an array of unions or something. Clearly each ULL_ADV_PDU_HDR_FIELD_ bit defines a structured value (e.g. ULL_ADV_PDU_HDR_FIELD_CTE_INFO which is just a uint8_t value and ULL_ADV_PDU_HDR_FIELD_SYNC_INFO which is more).

This is something I'm supporting and I should have thought about it when adding the change to the PR. 
