...
} else if (IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_NET_IPV6) && net_pkt_family(pkt) == AF_INET6) {
...
} else {
	return -EPFNOSUPPORT;
}
```
Then you can also remove the ifdefs around `create_ipv4_addr` and `create_ipv6_addr`"}

