	kbs_reg->KBS_KSOCTRL = IT8XXX2_KBS_KSOPU;
#if (CONFIG_KSCAN_ITE_IT8XXX2_COLUMN_SIZE > 16)
	/* Bit[0] = 1: Enable the open-drain mode of KSO[17:0] pins */
	kbs_reg->KBS_KSOCTRL |= IT8XXX2_KBS_KSOOD;
...
#endif
So I change to kbs_reg->KBS_KSOCTRL = (IT8XXX2_KBS_KSOOD | IT8XXX2_KBS_KSOPU); 
and this is okay for KSO16 and KSO17 when column size is 16."}]

